<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 250 million mark two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 250 million mark two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 1M-LIBOR  MATURITY    08.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     5 BP	PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.04    FULL FEES   8 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    100.0</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    4 BP	SELL CONC  4 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
